%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e7f30f51b8ce4acb88ac528f35c4f85d, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarratorVoiceBank
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  captionFont: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 2c4d93be511cf4720910a1b57c26f54f, type: 3}
  lines:
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_intro
    text: The sun is up over Kylo's house, and a brand new school day is starting.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d890acdc4646e4b68a056c733d8ef6e4, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_bangon_story
    text: Good morning! Kylo is still sleeping. It is time to wake up and start his day!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bda445b2f721e4890b6b8db9e7a94ff1, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_bangon_ask
    text: Let's help Kylo out of bed! Say {word} to wake him up!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 57c6071418a2445a986e67a4aa0bca3d, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_bangon_done
    text: Great job! Kylo is finally awake.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ed05fbf97a11746be9d0bdfa22202a2a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_tayo_story
    text: Kylo is awake, but he is still sitting on his bed. He needs to stand up first.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1e4342c170b7a433fb8210cf4beb4abc, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_tayo_ask
    text: "Help Kylo onto his feet \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7b2cdca9ce08a47569a3f560da121663, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_tayo_done
    text: Well done! Kylo is standing beside his bed now.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b1c10844acf04475bb90d631353f2b1c, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_lakad_story
    text: Kylo is standing, and the bedroom door is waiting across the room.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 01135f142b3d0477e9137c2f79e26fa7, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_lakad_ask
    text: Send him on his way with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 95f528acb0d9c43278a1984118effe43, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_lakad_done
    text: Excellent! Kylo is walking towards the door.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4135be31e26a7441cbe797d92c62e596, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_outro
    text: Nice work! Kylo is out of bed. Now let's help him get to the bathroom.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 00cdcb2e6bc5b4e02b3d1f089a4e8641, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_intro
    text: Kylo is out of his room, and the hallway stretches away in front of him.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 68ce5e2d2b81947f0a7f928a7ed41728, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_lakad_story
    text: The hallway is long and quiet, and the bathroom is at the far end.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 87910f07c76ee4f98827d4f7688b62c6, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_lakad_ask
    text: Start him moving with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2f646f3d2dcc344c496729673ab7c6b4, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_lakad_done
    text: Good! Kylo is walking down the hallway.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4b2f33ec968714a98b15d172b0fe1b44, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_kaliwa_story
    text: Kylo has stopped. There are doors on both sides, and he is not sure which way.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2d438447d35ee4d01b40d6526790e8cd, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_kaliwa_ask
    text: "Point him to the left \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ef226f96de3d54086b2c24ec4e990dd5, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_kaliwa_done
    text: That's it! Kylo is looking to his left.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f9b9fbe870ebf47ef8d767a177b4e454, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_kanan_story
    text: Nothing on the left but Nanay's room. The other side is worth a look.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a98f67de618f649689d74c8716f7913e, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_kanan_ask
    text: Turn him the other way with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4aab9544b5a454c0b9860f2ec4384cf5, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_kanan_done
    text: Good eye! The bathroom door is on his right.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 27a8e0be4dd644f97b59a6f5615f741a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_bukas_story
    text: Kylo has found the bathroom door, but it is shut tight.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6f826256a3bef4b47b98115d29188a41, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_bukas_ask
    text: Let's get that door open! Say {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2c2e1fdeacd3440ca9d894114212bbbe, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_bukas_done
    text: Wonderful! The door swings open for Kylo.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a66bcdc47a56f4786b12f4bcfc74192f, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_ilaw_story
    text: Inside the bathroom it is still dark, and Kylo cannot see a thing.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 03c7bc238d8f349e5a6284f9c8cf5fed, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_ilaw_ask
    text: "Brighten the room for him \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d6efe90b7f8c0494a8d25156a8914d2c, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_ilaw_done
    text: Perfect! The bathroom is bright and warm now.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2e1dd346ec8034d0088272395c23d9e6, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_outro
    text: Everything is ready. Now Kylo can take his bath.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1408ff31217d7469db48084ba556c845, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_intro
    text: The bathroom is ready, and so is Kylo.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0347c1f766cad4b9bbdb0a4a5cb86476, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_tuwalya_story
    text: When Kylo finishes washing, he will be soaking wet from head to toe.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 11b093294565e4e679103c3453bc21aa, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_tuwalya_ask
    text: "Get him something to dry with \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dc3996af59da24175add99677723fe6b, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_tuwalya_done
    text: Good! Kylo has his towel ready for afterwards.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_sabon_story
    text: Water alone will not get Kylo clean. He needs something that makes bubbles.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 70dd3de6028fa4183be92d08ca598c59, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_sabon_ask
    text: "Help him reach for it \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 706fd8b14ae7c4e97a42e4b910755da9, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_sabon_done
    text: Great! Kylo has the soap ready for his bath.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 01b002a69bf67431395c110c28c1b64c, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_maligo_story
    text: The water is cool and the soap is ready. This is Kylo's favourite part.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0bec2716c7bbf47479c5f688eea51cc8, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_maligo_ask
    text: Let's get him washing! Say {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 48fa2a28d391643e5968ce6bce8ea23b, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_maligo_done
    text: Wonderful! Kylo is clean from head to toe.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 134340ebf598242caaf172e5f3841950, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_sipilyo_story
    text: Kylo's teeth need cleaning too, before breakfast and before school.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a6d56480716e47019e41c5bbddd4cd4, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_sipilyo_ask
    text: Hand him the right one by saying {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 698a47053d24846c38b2b965e52d9550, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_sipilyo_done
    text: Well done! Kylo is brushing his teeth.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 306dfb27ee929452ab8e06829c838570, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_suklay_story
    text: Kylo is clean, but his hair is sticking up in every direction.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3f37f9e04bcc24de6b167925d38e2ec3, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_suklay_ask
    text: "Tidy it up for him \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6eb312b8c253b456186d0ee73c8482b2, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_suklay_done
    text: Very nice! Kylo's hair is neat and smooth.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 120180142534f427bad9d6731dbbf76d, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_outro
    text: All clean! Now Kylo needs to get dressed for school.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 84d016a33cef54c8f8d659bef0f8e2e5, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_intro
    text: Kylo is back in his bedroom, dripping wet and wrapped in his towel.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 429c29b90d1914e67a27d1608da5fd3a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_damit_story
    text: Kylo cannot go to school in his towel. His uniform is folded on the bed.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 48610cb6ebca4468d9bcf8595a9605e1, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_damit_ask
    text: "Help him put them on \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 48f8306bd1c2b417c864ab815149b131, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_damit_done
    text: Wonderful! Kylo is dressed in his school uniform.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d512f66d2d3cd4c57af70de206c7fa4e, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_medyas_story
    text: Kylo's feet are still bare, and the bedroom floor is cold.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8b4eb572570e3400cb50eafe9bd27d4f, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_medyas_ask
    text: Warm them up for him! Say {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b46c5047cbd00488fa7b1f2fe13542fe, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_medyas_done
    text: Nice! Kylo has his socks on.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c94c142820d6a42bd82099aa739d4c6d, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_sapatos_story
    text: Socks alone will not do for the long walk to school.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c5e1df44d326045e8be4f83dcaedb111, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_sapatos_ask
    text: Finish his feet off with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e7f42c4fe70904a69a9f07c98b903141, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_sapatos_done
    text: Great job! Kylo is ready to walk anywhere.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e7b98cae434e44eb981387b3072e973c, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_bag_story
    text: Kylo's books are packed and waiting on the chair by the door.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 59cdddfc86887480695100440bcf2b7a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_bag_ask
    text: "Point him at it \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 710c0c237666a405aad9d75935769aa7, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_bag_done
    text: Good! Kylo has spotted his school bag.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f52a7f99def51409097581d48b7910d4, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_kunin_story
    text: The bag is right there, but it will not carry itself.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b6956b8c8517453a92294312d560835, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_kunin_ask
    text: Help him pick it up by saying {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 398f9f5e83dec4a9aa0802daf9a188d2, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_kunin_done
    text: Excellent! Kylo has his bag over his shoulder.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0d6e05466c0d743f5ac69db7154d3f47, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_outro
    text: Kylo is dressed and packed. But first, he needs his breakfast!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d622a774b56a9433a899e03a277724bd, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_intro
    text: Nanay has made breakfast, and the whole kitchen smells wonderful.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe6dd5eb5f03d4fa8addd49cb7b57078, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_upo_story
    text: Breakfast is on the table, and Kylo's chair is empty and waiting.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0cc4d6011b39e4366aa60ddf8145ece1, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_upo_ask
    text: "Get him settled \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fc4ed37257a624ffea79f6280d94f071, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_upo_done
    text: Good! Kylo is sitting at the table.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c3b84ab636adf48498239f9c9c8bc1d7, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_kanin_story
    text: There is a warm white heap on Kylo's plate. Filipino families eat it daily.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dad401bf5afcd4e9da0e507f2c490d25, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_kanin_ask
    text: "Name it for Kylo \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e6a0963d34ae41d6a721c0570bb43a0, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_kanin_done
    text: That's right! Kylo's plate is full of rice.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cb5a1290605c6431095218e83d351528, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_itlog_story
    text: Beside the rice is something round, with a sunny yellow middle.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 03115179d54bd419ba25d7d273136fdf, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_itlog_ask
    text: "Tell Kylo what it is \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6cc4cfd8716334a78a874d9e0fea1e85, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_itlog_done
    text: Well done! The egg is Kylo's favourite part.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8125ccb555f454265a30a30bfe27022e, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_kain_story
    text: Everything is on the plate now, and Kylo's tummy is rumbling.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb9f36ea78e6f4570bf16651a8a4c42d, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_kain_ask
    text: Let him start his breakfast! Say {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 226028426c3304d509b7cc03857ab36b, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_kain_done
    text: Yummy! Kylo is enjoying every bite.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5bb43fe3a2a05452981e783c396c9c4e, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_inom_story
    text: All that rice has made Kylo thirsty. There is a glass beside his plate.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4851cd7b683d74375b492c40ec596204, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_inom_ask
    text: Help him finish it off with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9cb30b2c3281049bcb4a565465923eb4, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_inom_done
    text: Wonderful! Kylo's breakfast is all done.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bd17b6a5a79bc493c8a5e8290daea5d1, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_outro
    text: Breakfast is finished. It is time for Kylo to head off to school!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cb1e7840367b240259306c0e49696611, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_intro
    text: Here is Kylo's school! The gate is still shut, and the guard is waiting beside it.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4c955351337324fec84b3e52908b6dd1, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_lakad_story
    text: Kylo can see his school now. The gate up ahead is still shut.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1495b839d788c4d2f8eaf2ad3deabae5, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_lakad_ask
    text: "Walk him up to it \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 35f38b3c9b6024eaa8979d9c9cbcce89, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_lakad_done
    text: There he is, right at the gate.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 10fda488da4ed47ffaba9fb57c8dc46c, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_bukas_story
    text: The guard is standing beside the gate, waiting to let him in.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd3878082ae704d108ee67dd27928474, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_bukas_ask
    text: "Ask him to open it \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4b19807c14aa64dfc8c42c9b2d46a562, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_bukas_done
    text: The gate swings open!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bf56ee8bc19b847e599026472462e1ee, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_kumusta_story
    text: The guard at the gate smiles at Kylo every single morning.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3e3a0920e4a514e7bafb935eb538dd29, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_kumusta_ask
    text: "Greet him back \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 019372be0727b4b52a360f7c7540b061, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_kumusta_done
    text: Lovely manners! The guard waves Kylo through.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 40300ba9607e449d080b95c612eb8278, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_pasok_story
    text: The gate is open, and the school building is just across the yard.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d7ee7591fb0224cdcb15b0311b20accb, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_pasok_ask
    text: Take him inside with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3c1c47b400c5b42ab9e6d7fa1f639af5, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_pasok_done
    text: Good! Kylo is through the gate.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c6c173a0f51cc4c219059fb491fc94e1, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_takbo_story
    text: The bell is about to ring, and walking will not be fast enough.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 970412a12588d462dbfab61fa50155e9, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_takbo_ask
    text: "Hurry him along \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7c96caece5af849d6b488b2a92af7df2, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_takbo_done
    text: Excellent! Kylo made it before the bell.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 61bf7553b59e54ce2820cf18fd489f28, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_outro
    text: You made it in time! Now let's find Kylo's classroom.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d6e2a5347261a4aec918176f3b648ca9, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_intro
    text: Here is Kylo's classroom. His chair is waiting for him by the window.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 72ada230a0857429d9dfa97ce5d49a3d, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_lakad_story
    text: Kylo is inside the classroom, and his own chair is across the room by the window.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 836b4558a1ea14705ac31c7e4fce9adb, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_lakad_ask
    text: "Walk him over to it \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 80b04d6f6bb874a47a48e8d8c87c9574, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_lakad_done
    text: There he is, right beside his desk.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3fe0f95bcb27946819225f14e4c809d9, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_upo_story
    text: Kylo's desk is beside the window, and the lesson is about to start.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 244f2dfe7793d4c60943c26c146a9461, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_upo_ask
    text: "Get him into his chair \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4721a7a57c37c4f72a46f66d845acb32, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_upo_done
    text: Good! Kylo is in his seat, ready to learn.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3653bbe6b655f4fccaf50359c1e9f359, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_kuha_story
    text: The lesson is starting, and Kylo's desk is completely empty.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1bd05e648d48e4088b7b35a913cb1669, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_kuha_ask
    text: "Reach into the bag for him \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 91eb78967310e4bd99e52d854fe14d31, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_kuha_done
    text: Nice! Kylo is reaching into his school bag.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f01ca0b8178ac43e781a193efc7dce3f, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_lapis_story
    text: There is one thing Kylo needs before he can write anything down.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 569015b7c8a204cde8a59e21358245fd, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_lapis_ask
    text: "Name it for him \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 201fc55d14c7d4dd2a34dcc7421aacbb, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_lapis_done
    text: Well done! Kylo has his pencil on the desk.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: afd8362b61f2c4f90ab682622d1c7b5b, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_outro
    text: Kylo is ready. It is time for the lesson to begin!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2ee0cd3354cd844a5984619a31cf3ea7, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_intro
    text: Teacher Rachel is at the board, and today's lesson is about to start.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bb3ea56338e9c44298094638c25073cd, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_aklat_story
    text: Teacher Rachel asks the class to take something out of their bags.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: abf53342c065b47eca9454b3e54ab56a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_aklat_ask
    text: "Help Kylo find it \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae36d893a51b8453f9f388fe4053138f, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_aklat_done
    text: Good! Kylo's book is open on his desk.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e4d0ef07da49f4edf964b855f59e5a57, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_basa_story
    text: The page is open, and the whole class is following along out loud.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7a5d3c9936fe845cf9ce7c4004a1f3a9, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_basa_ask
    text: "Let Kylo join in \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ed3a95f64fbe74da594db3cf1a421886, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_basa_done
    text: Wonderful! Kylo is reading with the class.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aa7edd8d1d9934fafb8934479fd1057d, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_sulat_story
    text: Teacher Rachel writes a new word on the board for everyone to copy.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d48b3f8fdb46d4cc7963f673a7d070a5, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_sulat_ask
    text: Get his pencil moving with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7f8b7104641404bf59a30a8444d52058, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_sulat_done
    text: Excellent! Kylo is writing the word down.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2e345301677ec4ebda21356295a3373a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_tanong_story
    text: Kylo does not understand one part, and his hand goes half way up.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 681497335ddba49fcb65207005fd092b, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_tanong_ask
    text: "Give him the courage \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 47e0b4b067fb140dba627137d53f126a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_tanong_done
    text: Brave boy! Kylo has asked his question.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bcbf9a232143b4b839479b935289956c, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_sagot_story
    text: Teacher Rachel turns to Kylo and waits for him to reply.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d9bbf42994c754604a02e2beb23c8c2e, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_sagot_ask
    text: Help him speak up by saying {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: decc54a95992f4f58813ef76f3683547, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_sagot_done
    text: Well done! Kylo gave the right answer.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2094c3342a66b4c27a4339e5501febc0, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_outro
    text: Excellent work! Kylo is learning so many new words.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 442f490db94ac4bc286bd4eb7d3070d6, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_intro
    text: The recess bell has rung, and the classroom is emptying fast.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aaa170ad75041483a85926ec29c67427, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_labas_story
    text: Kylo's classmates are already streaming out into the sunshine.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1b79ed27b14bf4397abfc3fc39b2ea9d, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_labas_ask
    text: "Let him out into the sun \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c786225ca637a4256a9e79354628e8cd, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_labas_done
    text: Good! Kylo is out in the school yard.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e3c57839a99ff4a2ab9a14de8977d8a8, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_kain_story
    text: Nanay packed Kylo a snack, and it is still sitting in his bag.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9bffe07bc80c148448128ac2c33f6c4c, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_kain_ask
    text: "Let him start his snack \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5219ee520d52444fbb0cc31f993e6f00, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_kain_done
    text: Yummy! Kylo has finished his snack.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3fe6b08b19e4a436e9d61295cf0642b6, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_laro_story
    text: Kylo's classmates are chasing each other across the yard.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 360a0b7810b3f42a69b5d3427930347e, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_laro_ask
    text: Send him over to join them! Say {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fcfe793e655df473daebb8f013ecd3dc, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_laro_done
    text: Wonderful! Kylo is playing with his classmates.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e044f31b9722e4001aad4e258c00dc28, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_tawa_story
    text: One of Kylo's friends makes the silliest face in the whole school.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 593af02480f8b4076b7d12cbb29e45d0, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_tawa_ask
    text: "Let it out of him \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9cbc2967ef5db4dba984225e53b665f1, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_tawa_done
    text: What a happy sound! Kylo is laughing.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2b0ae6f997618419bbf3f9353f0019f9, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_tulong_story
    text: A smaller child has tripped and dropped everything on the ground.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ccc40981d6d3243b4bb3d74ae811ce09, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_tulong_ask
    text: Send Kylo over with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: db4621a0494024ff3a6d50d442b7dfbf, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_tulong_done
    text: So kind! Kylo helped the little one up.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8046153bece1e4a189eaecb978ac1724, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_outro
    text: That was fun, but recess is over. Back to class!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d277e1e68f93c46779944fc034598818, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_intro
    text: Recess is over. There is one more lesson before home time.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f8f047b1351fc4674b6984fed16d3b6e, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_pasok_story
    text: The classroom door is open, and the afternoon lesson is waiting.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 361e5b8bf2a1b41aa83832cdebdfbd20, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_pasok_ask
    text: "Take him back inside \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fa1cd8ed6412e44eb9caca8ced34ec60, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_pasok_done
    text: Good! Kylo is back in the classroom.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 69aeae3adc78048a68cfb46cc49940b9, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_upo_story
    text: Kylo's desk is just where he left it before recess.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b9f1e6b87c61b4a508675dfa3391f61a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_upo_ask
    text: Settle him down with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9f52380b240284419ad1112970b4c928, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_upo_done
    text: Good! Kylo is sitting at his desk again.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd4bf1dc25adb408c9542655fa0b5f11, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_linis_story
    text: The lesson is over, and there are papers and crayons all over the desk.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5f5f369ef33a241779478802ff3fbd7e, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_linis_ask
    text: "Tidy it up with him \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb838fef9c69b44168f54faccee894cb, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_linis_done
    text: Spotless! Kylo's desk is neat again.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1cb25b3fd27b8421cb00bbb032ee5ca7, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_bag_story
    text: Kylo's things are tidy, but they still need somewhere to go.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3df67ffb1065d4506bc8292690356791, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_bag_ask
    text: "Point him at it \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c9b3404d04e664e6a9da83ed2b22ca83, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_bag_done
    text: Good! Everything is packed away safely.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e49096bd43d0a40a58e13c0275189097, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_alis_story
    text: The last bell has rung, and Nanay is waiting outside the gate.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7b39bcda6b6984eddb7f34919f0691c1, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_alis_ask
    text: "Set him off for home \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7e268d377ae964d8aba6743491c1e2b8, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_alis_done
    text: Great job! Kylo's school day is finished.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1e36ea66417e249889799ed88e842187, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_outro
    text: Well done! Kylo has finished his whole school day.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8300433a289c14716bc1eaf600dea4fb, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_intro
    text: School is over, and the park is just down the road.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3443f8661bb0c48489a36e0e998089cf, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_lakad_story
    text: It is a sunny afternoon, and Kylo has nowhere else he needs to be.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6baceb4be1afd492d89d0d08d6237fc6, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_lakad_ask
    text: "Start him off \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8ad069582f969414db40a90a06e1d7b3, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_lakad_done
    text: Good! Kylo is on his way to the park.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bf50ed3ad66354a1ab47aa6594ba9864, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_takbo_story
    text: Kylo can see the park gate ahead, and he cannot wait any longer.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3db607a6142c84a93b0c7e971f948f71, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_takbo_ask
    text: Speed him up with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 908252f9db04d410a842768c1418b9be, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_takbo_done
    text: Wonderful! Kylo is almost at the park.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a0a8524665c14ef78fdbc73b774739c, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_tingin_story
    text: Something bright and colourful is moving behind the park fence.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 073f4409a2965436fbd0f5fd68449da9, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_tingin_ask
    text: "Turn his head that way \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d2a1d47979e64423a90963d0a543f2c9, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_tingin_done
    text: There it is! Kylo has spotted the playground.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f169264d0d4b24a46aac9349356ab38c, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_tuwa_story
    text: "Swings, a slide and a seesaw \u2014 exactly what Kylo was hoping for."
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f4aae2218ae4946f4b8e0fed2afc8983, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_tuwa_ask
    text: Let him show it! Say {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f66483a73c4a84c54809ce84c84ef40c, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_tuwa_done
    text: Look at that smile! Kylo is full of joy.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c3be64cd70b9e4fe4a5e779d21e846d4, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_pasok_story
    text: The park gate is open, and the grass looks soft and green.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e1548002fb5b344918e47552f71b3acc, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_pasok_ask
    text: "Take him in \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1183c6afac08840038635237d8e15d41, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_pasok_done
    text: Here we are! Kylo is inside the park.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 09fb110dbfee34c969aaa2ef1c299110, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s1_outro
    text: Kylo is at the park at last. Let's go and play!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dcc1ca4daf4de455fb5a334238b0210c, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_intro
    text: The playground is busy and the sun is still high.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2e75f49ad689f42bbb4b088185f76cd1, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_akyat_story
    text: The slide is tall, and its ladder goes all the way up to the top.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: feea4d57628ef4368b15233e135eb1d1, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_akyat_ask
    text: "Start him up the ladder \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 62e790720055e464d9af236c77beb199, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_akyat_done
    text: Up he goes! Kylo is at the top of the slide.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cfd10c6b44bda4e90a1a61828ee42c18, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_dausdos_story
    text: Kylo is at the top now, looking down the long shiny slide.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 08ae989851d9f42cd898667ce0e214cf, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_dausdos_ask
    text: Send him down with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: af4a31cb858184a7ba82b4738af28fe2, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_dausdos_done
    text: Wheee! Kylo slid all the way to the bottom.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 71d38a2a10e2b47a49b78633d0b4d389, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_sakay_story
    text: An empty swing is rocking gently, waiting for somebody to use it.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 60d42a9db57b841e3890f7771dc331f3, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_sakay_ask
    text: "Get him on board \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dbfe7a82a374e4745948a4da9ef296a4, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_sakay_done
    text: Nice! Kylo is sitting on the swing.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 900c15ae52d88470493b9ae52bb97872, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_tulak_story
    text: Kylo is on the swing, but a swing cannot start by itself.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3448002cbca154b2d8d45fa557dca29b, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_tulak_ask
    text: "Give it a shove \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 344460f4b4dd449c5b3fe3e9243d939a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_tulak_done
    text: Higher and higher! Kylo is swinging.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0f739e60e75714225a840fa43845927d, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_talon_story
    text: The swing is slowing down, and Kylo wants to land in the sand.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6dc4d895bcc6a4d5ba3d31c5fad777cf, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_talon_ask
    text: "Launch him off \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c48c7f846f8fe4b648b63dca1b59b024, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_talon_done
    text: What a landing! Kylo is safe in the sand.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7615d1a6c709442ff8fcce0f8e0b02d4, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s2_outro
    text: Wow! Kylo is having so much fun today.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f3a67a23228344f189330d4fccceb18b, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_intro
    text: Two children Kylo has never met are playing over by the swings.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b2a5546fd9ca14d01acddb708ef4d234, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_kumusta_story
    text: The two children look over at Kylo and wave at him.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5bb988f0a4d384ac09d3e7e31c822c9f, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_kumusta_ask
    text: "Break the ice for him \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6a82eb3f3cbb1417099e783e4fbe30d7, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_kumusta_done
    text: Lovely! Kylo has said hello to them.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1d11cec8a4ca94397a870043c76be996, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_ngiti_story
    text: Kylo is a little shy, and his face has gone very serious.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3188538a8d5da4dc6af773736e11d9cf, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_ngiti_ask
    text: "Soften his face \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1747797e3ac454c6bb2738a00f23782c, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_ngiti_done
    text: Much better! Kylo's smile makes them smile too.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 212e29c0d2edc42f3bc85bbfaacdcb77, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_tanong_story
    text: Kylo would like to know their names, but the words are stuck.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4f6b60d60f9674f8b84ef73920b95af2, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_tanong_ask
    text: "Help him speak up \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d6efc47aa241148b4b1e7bf8e1a565e1, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_tanong_done
    text: Well done! Kylo asked them their names.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fa8a8dbd9ac414e67ad963cdf3d2c6ab, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_laro_story
    text: His new friends are starting a game of tag, and they want Kylo in it.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f08e9dae5b20f4c2db4e659850a983bb, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_laro_ask
    text: "Send him over \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ecf71aeac6c8b43eba0cb9e7cb30c662, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_laro_done
    text: Wonderful! Kylo is playing with his new friends.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 295a502acd9d24c5794b13f9a9719dbe, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_bati_story
    text: A third child arrives and stands quietly at the edge of the game.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aa01e43a21be748098dfcbaf40deeb28, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_bati_ask
    text: "Make him welcome \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f11012602de14289bc693fd020ec06a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_bati_done
    text: So friendly! Kylo welcomed him into the game.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 448356697094440d7a3c040bc092be37, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s3_outro
    text: New friends already! Playing is hungry work, though.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b40874e0814c246c18fd5a32bd0ecd7a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_intro
    text: Someone has spread a mat under the big tree, with food in the middle.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 22be095da37e4430d9cb0d0400d06043, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_upo_story
    text: Everyone is finding a place to sit, and there is a gap beside his friends.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a9940af2cd4ca4256b987ad6d01a0103, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_upo_ask
    text: "Find him a spot \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1b1d90f9584d84ade83083c86e479e6f, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_upo_done
    text: Good! Kylo is sitting on the picnic mat.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8a61c916cec2e474194df65eaa1a7799, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_kain_story
    text: There are sandwiches and sliced fruit laid out on the mat.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cffdb5bf88cd44244991792ee208f860, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_kain_ask
    text: "Let him dig in \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bcf0b45ce93794e09b4fa4d5b365853b, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_kain_done
    text: Yummy! Kylo is enjoying the picnic.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4551b3c5e963f47d0999fddbb05645ba, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_ibahagi_story
    text: Kylo has more food than he can finish, and his friends have none.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2d8feeb1720394ef4986db0e8cadfce6, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_ibahagi_ask
    text: "Be generous for him \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8bfc8322808904786924bf64f80801ef, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_ibahagi_done
    text: How kind! Everyone has something to eat now.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 978daaa5a258b4c63bb11cb998f0b552, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_inom_story
    text: All that running has made the whole group very thirsty.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0d554ca8a65764a92aba260d2b443bd5, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_inom_ask
    text: "Pass him the juice \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1d5dc7099fdfb4f6c84d6db085946dad, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_inom_done
    text: Refreshing! Kylo is not thirsty any more.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a43ab452000e544c6adc6b49ceb100c1, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_salamat_story
    text: Kylo's new friends shared their own snacks with him too.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b722f308477724807b4c069a7a51eb4a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_salamat_ask
    text: "Mind his manners \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 82ddd9640630649ad9a671b3e0bb466c, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_salamat_done
    text: Beautiful manners! Kylo thanked his friends.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2ca8ac95c74c24af88d1c21a8183548a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s4_outro
    text: Sharing makes snack time even better.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 58053a100559d427197105e0f1002da8, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_intro
    text: The sky is turning orange, and the day at the park is nearly over.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f446db66cd4f84d31886e7ccdbc3bb16, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_paalam_story
    text: Kylo's new friends are picking up their things. It is time to part.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5ee8bc408c8b143ce9346031996e4006, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_paalam_ask
    text: "Send them off kindly \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b090c39e05fa9431fa531e0aff9c77d9, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_paalam_done
    text: Sweet! Kylo waved his friends goodbye.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d1fd1d09bd920419b8d4c26ec8992593, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_lakad_story
    text: The park gate is behind Kylo now, and home is down the road.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9a5a75430b6ba4f759def149b217b04f, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_lakad_ask
    text: "Start him homeward \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f47ba7d0309b149a1900f03139d419e4, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_lakad_done
    text: Good! Kylo is walking home.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3d28c7744621d44afbd9ff6d90aaa8c4, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_tingin_story
    text: Something is glowing warmly at the far end of the street.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae6c3416e2eaf4329a4436ee97acc8f7, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_tingin_ask
    text: "Turn his head \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 64a1d433555764a8c92c8196086c96b2, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_tingin_done
    text: There it is! Kylo can see his own house.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: afcc1097a7ba14be39226c6607719736, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_pagod_story
    text: It has been a very long day, and Kylo's legs are getting heavy.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 21fd2a27240f942e2affd117d0770ce8, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_pagod_ask
    text: "Let him admit it \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 051b9cbac65b04bcb8cc06b143d5850a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_pagod_done
    text: What a day! Kylo is ready for a rest.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d12b00039e4664090b1809e640354ed8, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_uwi_story
    text: Nanay has left the lamp on, and the front door is just ahead.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2f796c8aab9f442f19ab6e30539651e9, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_uwi_ask
    text: "Bring him home \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e9be9142fc133460e90f8dcd9884f16e, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_uwi_done
    text: Home at last! Kylo had a wonderful day.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a028a528fdcc548ed921ff88fc195214, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_s5_outro
    text: What a day! Kylo is home safe and happy.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f5b5a2cc70a9545cd88fb458871fa118, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_complete_summary
    text: You helped Kylo finish his whole morning routine!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d823286f610c84a0ebf550fbc9ecb732, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l1_complete_badge
    text: Bahay Badge Unlocked!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1babb57976f0144e796f377794b93836, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_complete_summary
    text: Great job! Kylo finished his school day!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3b5ce2f48a0a946bab487c1bf1f70a9a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l2_complete_badge
    text: Paaralan Badge Unlocked!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0b2e6a5588dd842aebdf0068590b3964, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_complete_summary
    text: Amazing! Kylo had a wonderful day!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7a8bc42c32a234b1784661e38d495fa5, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_l3_complete_badge
    text: Parke Badge Unlocked!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 319f7ecc52f664bf29ef0455b6fb18c6, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_bangon_teach
    text: In Filipino, 'Bangon' means to get up, or to rise from bed.
    gloss: Get up
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f25cce15f9d4945fb85d9ad76ddebc59, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_bangon_recall
    text: Remember, 'Bangon' means to get up.
    gloss: Get up
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 70204496283354ed5a5a81cd2fcdcd66, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_tayo_teach
    text: The Filipino word 'Tayo' means to stand up.
    gloss: Stand up
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: afb67f7cc702746bebe22c21f1eb98aa, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_tayo_recall
    text: Remember, 'Tayo' means to stand up.
    gloss: Stand up
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c1c514fe6fca347769290a6aeede20df, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_lakad_teach
    text: In Filipino, 'Lakad' means to walk.
    gloss: Walk
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4eb0e454844f04f4f8f278d49707ddb4, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_lakad_recall
    text: Remember, 'Lakad' means to walk.
    gloss: Walk
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c97b1b3982485429dbebef34378eb80b, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_kaliwa_teach
    text: '''Kaliwa'' is the Filipino word for left, the side of your left hand.'
    gloss: Left
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7fb2f7d8f47d6495aae8ed469c0ed0ff, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_kaliwa_recall
    text: Remember, 'Kaliwa' means left.
    gloss: Left
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f95ac5ff28144467b96d7e0cbda96c8, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_kanan_teach
    text: '''Kanan'' is the Filipino word for right, the other side from kaliwa.'
    gloss: Right
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4e41074169db24cbba8b879d99de3091, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_kanan_recall
    text: Remember, 'Kanan' means right.
    gloss: Right
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cad06110a12d747eb9eea82215118b7e, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_bukas_teach
    text: In Filipino, 'Bukas' means open.
    gloss: Open
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: faf5dbba65b6a4b96ba36c32a1069fe8, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_bukas_recall
    text: Remember, 'Bukas' means open.
    gloss: Open
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 75ca06d07f8e545a08dc918c8e64cd98, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_ilaw_teach
    text: '''Ilaw'' is the Filipino word for light, the one you switch on.'
    gloss: Light (turn on)
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ab3aa37ab8d854f1cb2d99f4db04c501, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_ilaw_recall
    text: Remember, 'Ilaw' means the light.
    gloss: Light (turn on)
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 73faff73581ef4acc9c94bf8c7bf74f0, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_maligo_teach
    text: In Filipino, 'Maligo' means to take a bath.
    gloss: Take a bath
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a635689bece544063add48586f77b294, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_maligo_recall
    text: Remember, 'Maligo' means to take a bath.
    gloss: Take a bath
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0f99eb56d81744385b0f26c3edfcfc30, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_sabon_teach
    text: '''Sabon'' is the Filipino word for soap.'
    gloss: Soap
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e128b65ff85b34865be581d3da6fe6e7, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_sabon_recall
    text: Remember, 'Sabon' means soap.
    gloss: Soap
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d4b00f8a1209244a8b19359d0b1b9b52, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_suklay_teach
    text: A 'Suklay' is a comb, for making tangled hair neat again.
    gloss: Comb
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 30b1a66e2cc3c4506af78c22c0822593, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_suklay_recall
    text: Remember, a 'Suklay' is a comb.
    gloss: Comb
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2665b43fa5adf40d9a6cdc5d687c238a, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_sipilyo_teach
    text: '''Sipilyo'' is the Filipino word for a toothbrush.'
    gloss: Toothbrush
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f79be4b90aba743a0807573eb5c5d1e1, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_sipilyo_recall
    text: Remember, 'Sipilyo' means toothbrush.
    gloss: Toothbrush
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8079ad76af0c445cb99779b5710cb8ae, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_tuwalya_teach
    text: A 'Tuwalya' is a towel, the soft cloth you dry yourself with.
    gloss: Towel
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eef9110d835e145aab89d997967a6070, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_tuwalya_recall
    text: Remember, a 'Tuwalya' is a towel.
    gloss: Towel
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ac6bc4046a21f4810a5d98efba2449b1, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_damit_teach
    text: '''Damit'' is the Filipino word for clothes, like Kylo''s school uniform.'
    gloss: Clothes / uniform
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 077830f55df33490494aa1146e2ae878, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_damit_recall
    text: Remember, 'Damit' means clothes.
    gloss: Clothes / uniform
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fcdc25656bf014d0b9c2e4b9a241721f, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_medyas_teach
    text: '''Medyas'' is the Filipino word for socks.'
    gloss: Socks
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6f9090d5846d446d9afed7708ba70bdb, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_medyas_recall
    text: Remember, 'Medyas' means socks.
    gloss: Socks
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 028c5674390ab4719a06b6775c02ad1f, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_sapatos_teach
    text: '''Sapatos'' is the Filipino word for shoes.'
    gloss: Shoes
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe86168f0fa524a139492cd5d297c169, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_sapatos_recall
    text: Remember, 'Sapatos' means shoes.
    gloss: Shoes
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7b7e739c58c8146728c9202173f67dec, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_bag_teach
    text: '''Bag'' means the same in Filipino as in English: something you carry things in.'
    gloss: Bag
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9447d6cfedd4840f2a56b99f6d9b8262, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_bag_recall
    text: Remember, 'Bag' means bag.
    gloss: Bag
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 414b99f37fa4049ff929dc87f206f0be, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_kunin_teach
    text: In Filipino, 'Kunin' means to take something, or to go and get it.
    gloss: Take / get
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd59798fbe2ce44fc9f58f1e8061391b, type: 3}
