    gloss: Eat
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 16a308902d6f744148fedee62f4c4436, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_kain_recall
    text: Remember, 'Kain' means to eat.
    gloss: Eat
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b82e2813439b944279b62825070f81cb, type: 3}
