    gloss: Drink
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 28016b2566c224e7a8bff40539e5c150, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_inom_recall
    text: Remember, 'Inom' means to drink.
    gloss: Drink
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 49ec1fc140ec84d84b13caf40ae08be9, type: 3}
  - id: rachel_word_kumusta_teach
    text: '''Kumusta'' is how you say hello in Filipino, and ask how someone is.'
    gloss: Hello / how are you
